```console
$ scherzo-cloud run cancel --help
Request cancellation of a Scherzo Cloud run

Usage: scherzo-cloud run cancel [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION> <RUN>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUN>           Run ID

Options:
      --force                          Request immediate containment instead of graceful stopping
      --idempotency-key <KEY>          Reuse this key to reconcile an uncertain request
      --wait                           Observe the run until it settles
      --timeout <DURATION>             Stop waiting after a positive duration (units: ms, s, m, or h)
      --json                           Print the run result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
